editor_description = "Hob, who keeps the Cross Keys with Agnes (design doc, 'The lane'): the innkeeper, who hears everything said over the ale. Big, red-faced, going bald; a tan tunic, a linen apron tied at his waist, an ale jug in his hand (tools/build/chr_hob.py). Model is his body on its skeleton, with his clips (PersonModel). Feet at the origin, facing -Z. Head is his face (a FaceRig over the head model); Face is where the conversation camera looks. In the game both ride on the skeleton's head."
